---
description: Prepare one mapCoverage evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: EditorialPitch[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Build a map of themes, formats, perspectives, and reader needs across proposed pieces. Identify genuine gaps and redundancy without forcing artificial balance between unsupported claims, and preserve coherent variety rather than filling slots mechanically. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
